      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Yate and YateClient&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This presentation&amp;#39;s main focus will be how to combine Yate and YateClient in order to allow an extended and unified communication center - we are talking here about Instant Messaging, telephone calls, conferences, besides your own telephony engine to use and configure to your liking.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The intertwined multiple communication threads are all put together and mastered as easy as 123.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
